## AGREEMENT OF LEASE

Commercial premises · Oakridge Business Park

## 1. PARTIES

1.1 This agreement of lease is entered into between Oakridge Property Holdings (Pty) Ltd (sample), registration number 2009/000000/07 ("the Landlord"), and Marula Office Supplies (Pty) Ltd, registration number 2014/000000/07 ("the Tenant").

1.2 The parties record that the Tenant has inspected the Premises and wishes to hire them on the terms of this lease.

## 2. DEFINITIONS AND INTERPRETATION

2.1 In this lease, unless the context indicates otherwise, the following words have the meanings given to them below:

2.1.1 "Building" means the office building known as Oakridge Business Park, erected on Erf 000, Sampleton, together with its parking areas and grounds;

2.1.2 "Business Day" means any day other than a Saturday, Sunday or public holiday in the Republic of South Africa;

2.1.3 "Commencement Date" means 1 February 2024;

2.1.4 "Common Areas" means those parts of the Building intended for use by all tenants, including entrances, passages, lifts, toilets and landscaped areas;

2.1.5 "Deposit" means the amount referred to in clause 6.1;

2.1.6 "Landlord's Agent" means any managing agent appointed by the Landlord from time to time and notified to the Tenant in writing;

2.1.7 "Lease Period" means the period commencing on the Commencement Date and ending on 31 January 2027, both days inclusive, and "Expiry Date" means the last day of that period;

